    A15_SMSS_71_M016935_025                                                   
                                                                              
    Apollo 15 Soil Mechanics                                                  
    Lunar Self-Recording Penetrometer (LSRP) Page D-4                         
                                                                              
    Post-Flight Pentration Calibration - Data and Analysis                    
                                                                              
    These handwritten tables give the readings on the Apollo 15 Lunar         
    Self-Recording Penetrometer (LSRP) drum and the actual penetration as     
    part of the post-flight calibration.  The first table gives the readings  
    at different positions on the drum, the actual interval measured, and     
    the ratio of the drum versus the actual intervals. The second table       
    gives the cumulative readings on the drum and the ratio of the            
    cumulative values. The page is dated 13 August 1971 at U.C. Berkeley.     
                                                                              
